          "id": 1433079985,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "README.developer says 'if you want an \"int-sized\" unsigned quantity, use \"unsigned\"', so I went with that. Searching Google for '\"unsigned\" vs \"unsigned int\"' returns a lot of admonishments against unsigned ints but not very many opinions on style.",
