          "id": 1431708211,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Presumably `guchar` should become `unsigned char` rather than `uint8_t`; if it means \"character but don't sign-extend it\", that's `guchar` or `unsigned char`, but if it's \"8-bit unsigned integer\", that's `guint8` or `uint8_t`.",
